\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Canary evaluation protocol.} When the SkillEditAgent produces an updated skill, it commits to a staging branch. A subset of users receives the staging version while the majority continues on main. UX scores from AtomTasks using each branch are aggregated; the staging branch is promoted only if statistically superior.}}{7}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
